title Free software by Knowbooks.com
description Three small tools for a brighter day. Track a storm, make a checksum you can say, or turn a PDF into one long image. Free to use and make your own.
baseUrl https://knowbooks.com/s/
permalink index.html
openGraphImage stormTracker/norbert.jpg
htmlLang en
buildHtml
metaTags

header
 id software-header
 a Knowbooks.com
  href ../index.html
  addClass brand
 a Source ↗
  href https://github.com/breck7/knowbooks.com/tree/main/s
  addClass header-link
main
 id software-main
 section
  addClass hero
  h1 Free software by Knowbooks.com
 section
  addClass tool-grid
  aria-label Free utilities
  a
   href stormTracker/index.html
   addClass tool
   img
    src stormTracker/norbert.jpg
    alt Storm Tracker dashboard with a Hawaii map, live cameras, and forecasts.
    width 1280
    height 720
   div
    addClass tool-copy
    h2 Storm Tracker
    Live cameras, satellite imagery, and forecasts. One clear view of the storm.
    span Open tracker ↗
     addClass tool-action
  a
   href checko/index.html
   addClass tool
   img
    src checko/og.jpg
    alt Checko: A checksum you can say. A paper scroll becomes a speech bubble of colorful words.
    width 1200
    height 629
   div
    addClass tool-copy
    h2 Checko
    A checksum you can say. Compare documents with a memorable phrase.
    span Try Checko ↗
     addClass tool-action
  a
   href longpic/index.html
   addClass tool
   img
    src longpic/og.png
    alt Longpic: a small PDF becomes one wonderfully long picture.
   div
    addClass tool-copy
    h2 Longpic
    Big PDF. One looong JPG. Stitch every page into an image, right in your browser.
    span Make a Longpic ↗
     addClass tool-action
footer
 id software-footer
 Built with Scroll.
  https://scroll.surf Scroll
 Copying is a human right.

css
 :root { color-scheme: light; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; color: #243d32; background: #f6f8f0; font-synthesis: none; }
 * { box-sizing: border-box; }
 body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0, #e7f2d9, transparent 65%); }
 a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
 header, main, footer { max-width: 1180px; margin: auto; }
 header { padding: 24px 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; }
 .brand { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
 .header-link { font-size: 13px; color: #526c5c; }
 main { padding: 0 28px; }
 .hero { max-width: 750px; margin: 24px auto 32px; text-align: center; }
 .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #547244; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
 h1 { margin: 0 auto 14px; max-width: 700px; font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 52px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.055em; font-weight: 750; text-wrap: balance; }
 .intro { max-width: 590px; margin: auto; color: #596d5f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; text-wrap: balance; }
 .tool-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
 .tool { display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #d7e1cd; border-radius: 14px; background: #fffffc; transition: transform .18s, border-color .18s; }
 .tool:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: #8aa876; }
 .tool img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; object-fit: contain; background: #f6f3e8; border-bottom: 1px solid #e3e9dc; }
 .tool-copy { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 20px; }
 .tool h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
 .tool p { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #617064; }
 .tool-action { margin-top: auto; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 650; color: #376b37; }
 footer { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 26px 28px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7c6c; }
 footer p { margin: 0; } footer a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
 a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #547c39; outline-offset: 4px; }
 @media (max-width: 760px) { header { padding: 20px; } main { padding: 0 20px; } .hero { margin: 16px auto 24px; } .intro { font-size: 14px; } .tool-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 14px; } .tool { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32% 1fr; } .tool img { height: 100%; aspect-ratio: auto; border-bottom: 0; border-right: 1px solid #e3e9dc; } .tool-copy { padding: 16px; } .tool h2 { font-size: 20px; } .tool p { font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 12px; } footer { padding: 24px 20px; } }
 @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { transition: none !important; } }
